      ":question/id": "6f2e167e-77c4-5518-b544-c2a1068fc50a",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos(x+210^\\circ)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use $\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v$ with $u=x$ and $v=210^\\circ$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos(x+210^\\circ)&=\\cos x\\cos 210^\\circ-\\sin x\\sin 210^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\cos x\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)-\\sin x\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin x-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
